{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Great plenty.</b> It is a noun like \"famine.\" Therefore the one who says in the Sabbath prayer ובשובע כלכלתנו with a vav errs, for שובע is a verb. The correct form is ובשבע כלכלתנו without a vav."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:40.527680805Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}